              {
                "text": "Escalation to `JudgeAdvisoryWithRationale` runs only in enforce with `escalateLowConfidence`, which ships off. No operator queue exists.",
                "kind": "note"
              },
              {
                "text": "In enforce, the worker job keeps the validation `passed` only when every warning is accepted (`worker-cycle.ts:470`)"
